 "english": {
  "elements": [
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“Kanchi” —",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "the weapon Anna left us—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "an arena for his feelings.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "He would write week after week......",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "and for it we would wait the whole week!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Every letter—a golden letter!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Every issue—a golden issue!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Lovely Tamil would charm......its artistry would outdo a river’s flow......",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "A style that had grown familiar......a style that laid the road",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "for the procession of rationalism......",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Read one, and laughter would come.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Read another, and thought would arise!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "He would begin by calling “Thambi”......where else",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "could there be such grandeur......where else such tenderness?",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "There is the city “Kanchi,” where the arts flourished.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "There too is the “Kanchi” of our dignified leader.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "But where is Anna?",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“Kanchi” is Anna......",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Anna is “Kanchi”......!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "The Pongal *Malar*......a flower like gold......",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "To savour the flavour of Kanchi’s Pongal,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "I too am one among those who wait!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 16,
    "printedPage": null
   }
  ],
